    "updated_at": "2021-02-11T09:20:38Z",
    "body": "When and where do user agents validate static ranges? If we have callers of that operation within the web platform, I agree it would make sense to define that operation in the DOM Standard.\r\n\r\nSeparately, it might make sense to then expose that operation to userland. I would probably put the method on the prototype so you can use it directly from an instance.\r\n\r\ncc @smaug---- ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
