    "created_at": "2021-02-11T09:28:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-11T09:28:00Z",
    "body": "For the [highlight API](https://www.w3.org/TR/css-highlight-api-1/), before we can paint a StaticRange-backed highlight, we have to first check if it is valid.\r\n\r\nThat's my use case, not sure if there are others. But I can imagine most (future) features that want to use StaticRange would need to do this.",
