    "created_at": "2021-08-27T21:40:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-27T21:41:09Z",
    "body": "I created a PR for this at https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/1009 now that CSSWG has [resolved ](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/4597#issuecomment-905688814) to use StaticRanges internally for Highlight API.\r\n\r\nI didn't include the public DOM API since I'm not sure that we have evidence of implementer interest for that part yet, but it could always be added in a later change if needed.",
